REQUIRE VERSION "1.15"
INCLUDE life_cell

# LIFE_CELL_TM7SF2 — TM7SF2 sterol Δ14-reductase after CYP51 on BA continuum
# Continuum ...->pcca->mcee->mut->suclg1->sdha->fh->mdh->cs->aco2->idh2->ogdh->scs->dld->dlst->oxct1->acat1->hmgcs2->hmgcl->bdh1->slc16a1->slc16a7->emb->aacs->hmgcs1->hmgcr->mvk->pmvk->mvd->idi1->fdps->sqs->sqle->lss->cyp51->tm7sf2 (TM7SF2 after CYP51)
# Gift: TM7SF2 opens 4,4-dimethyl-cholesta-8,14,24-trienol -> 4,4-dimethyl-cholesta-8,24-dienol Δ14-reductase gate under ASSERT after CYP51 open.
# Domain: post-CYP51 sterol Δ14-reductase (TM7SF2/DHCR14/ERG24) C14-C15 saturation gate.
# Cube is SoT. Free energy must flow. Not a dual ladder.

ENTITY mito OF Cell 1 44 0
ENTITY peri OF Cell 1 28 0
ENTITY ash OF Cell 0 18 0
ENTITY starve OF Cell 1 0 0
ENTITY nest OF Cell 1 52 0

